          "logs": [],
          "prompt": "In the UI, I don't like how, if you open the Dashboard and click around, then open an agent and switch back to the dashboard, you lose your place because it reloads the screen. Therefore, I think we need to treat the main nav the same way we do Tools (same theme, layout, and styles), so that clicking the main nav opens a new context menu, and clicking a context menu item opens that screen, making it persistent. The UI should be consistent with Tools and Planning since they work the way I want Main to work. Also, the Main icon will need to change too.",
